WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.400
What's happenin mah well read ballas?

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:19.650
This week we gettin red tape up in that ASS with
The Trial by Franz Kafka.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:25.189
Banker-man Joseph K. just turned 30 and now
he chillin at the crib waitin' fo some grub.

00:00:25.189 --> 00:00:27.250
S'all good til- KNOCK KNOCK.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.029
"Man dat BETTER be my foo-."

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:31.029
"Huh?

00:00:31.029 --> 00:00:33.309
Who this suit rollin up on my spot?"

00:00:33.309 --> 00:00:38.160
Apparently, this tight-ass dude representin
da law and lay it on K-baby raw: "You under

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:39.160
arrest, son."

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.160
"WHAAA?!

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.160
What I even do?"

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:46.370
But this cat and his boy keep their mouths
shut and don't give him no reason.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:51.550
So deez haters take K next door where there
be a ghetto-rigged court sesh goin down.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:58.059
Da top dawg inspector start runnin his mouth
bout how K is in some deep shit, but he STILL

00:00:58.059 --> 00:00:59.500
don't say why!

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.719
Da hell?

00:01:00.719 --> 00:01:04.610
K walks for now, but this mess sho' as hell
ain't over.

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:05.700
Not even close.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:10.551
Later, word come from the law dat K gotta
bust ass to court without tellin him what

00:01:10.551 --> 00:01:14.050
time, or the room number where all this goin
down'.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:18.550
Afta' sweatin his nuts off just tryna find
this place, he finally get to an attic in

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:24.830
a hood-ass building where da judge like "Boy
you an hour and five minutes late!"

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:26.080
Psh.

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:31.800
So K step up and rock the mic sayin this system
is straight CROOKED, but nobody give a damn

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.750
bout what he got to say.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:41.710
Later, K-baby on the grind when he hear somethin
funky- "Aw hell no.. people best not be gettin

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:46.020
freaky in MY bank- Uhhh..what da hell is goin
on?".

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:51.310
Apparently the suits who arrested K gettin
whooped on cuz K ratted on them in court fo'

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:52.920
tryna' boost his swag.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:58.250
K feel mad guilty, and wanna put a stop to
this mess, but da whippin man aint backin'

00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:59.490
down fo' nothing.

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:01.470
Brutha gotta do what he gotta do.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:06.710
Then K's uncle drop in and be all like "You
takin this case seriously boy?

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:08.810
Yo ass is on the LINE!"

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:14.730
So K's uncle introduces him to a lawyer named
Huld and his BANGIN' nurse Leni.

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:15.840
Mmm-mmm-MMM YEAH!

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.680
But Huld is completely f*ckin useless.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:24.350
Brutha ain't got a clue why K got the law
up his ass and there ain't nuthin he can do.

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:29.170
And if dat aint cray 'nuff, the Chief Clerk
of da court was just chillin in the shadows

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:33.970
this whole damn time just diddlin himself
o' somethin.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:39.170
As time go by, K keep hittin up his lawyer,
but this shyster never do jack sh*t!

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:44.560
Now K buggin so hard bout da case that a customer
roll up at work and be like: "Psst bruh.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:47.050
You should talk to my homey Titorelli.

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:50.160
He work up at the court so he know what's
what."

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:54.070
So K hit up Titorelli, who all like "Real
talk.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:55.540
You're basically fucked.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:59.840
They ain't never gonna call you innocent so
you might as well just bend over."

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:02.720
Now K thinkin' he gotta shake his punk-ass
lawyer.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:07.960
So he swang over to the office where this
raggedy dude named Block be chillin.

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:13.200
Apparently, Block was ballin' as a businessman
back in the day, but since the law came down

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:19.020
on his ass like they doin to K, he spent all
his cheddar on legal defense and now he all

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:20.319
cashed out on the struggle.

00:03:20.319 --> 00:03:25.480
When K try to break it off with Huld, da lawyer
like "Not so fast, bruh.

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:29.819
You walk away, and you ain't gonna be nuthin
but a dog like Block."

00:03:29.819 --> 00:03:34.430
Then the bank tell K he gotta show one of
their big dawg clients round town.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:40.660
Dude say he wanna peep game at the cathedral,
but when he a no show, K just check spot himself.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:45.800
Befo' he but to leave, da priest holler and
tell him he work for da court too.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:52.010
He try to explain K's bunk-ass sitiation with
a fable, but it don't mean a damn thing to

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:53.010
K.

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:55.550
A year go by since all this craziness first
went down.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:04:01.000
On da night before K's 31st birthday, two
suits arrive at his crib.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.770
This time, though, K ain't trippin bout it.

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:09.530
Matta' fact, K take the lead and they head
to a quarry where K put his head a boulder.

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:14.410
Then one of the suits shank him right in the
heart and TWIST.

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:25.150
K's last words befo' he take that long dirt
nap: "Like a dog!"

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:28.820
Man this trap Joey-K livin' in sho one crooked-ass
place.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:34.850
Brutha ain't got no rights, no voice, and
no options- da law got his nuts in a vice

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:37.030
and there ain't nuthin he can do bout it.

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:42.150
But da scurriest thang Kafka preachin is dat
it don't take a hardass thug puttin a glock

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:46.160
to yo dome in order to take away yo dignity
n' freedom.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:52.410
Naw blood, up in this hood homies are broken
down by a slow, orderly system dat's designed

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:56.660
to keep people in check even though it frontin'
like it all righteous.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:05:02.170
Like check this- Even though K never do any
time behind bars, it ain't cuz things all

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.170
good.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:07.650
Truth is, they don't need to throw K in the
slammer since erry-day in this society is

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:11.460
like livin' in the pen anyway - "You have misunderstood
me.

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:16.169
You are under arrest, certainly, but that
not need hinder you from going about your

00:05:16.169 --> 00:05:17.169
business.

00:05:17.169 --> 00:05:19.960
Nor will you be prevented from leading your
ordinary life."

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:23.960
Yuh, the man all the way up K's ass for this
whole damn book.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:27.550
But just cuz they the law sho as hell don't
mean they preachin justice.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:32.880
Matta fact, the "law" could be da most un-just
thang you eva' seen- but when you got people

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:38.310
follow it blindly, and enforce it just cuz
"it's their job"- da fact dat it ain't just

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:39.310
don't even matta'.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:42.100
Da law s'posed to protect yo' rights.

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:47.139
But up in here, it's nuthin' mo' than a weapon
to keep you scurred and in yo place.

00:05:47.139 --> 00:05:52.750
"Our officials... never go hunting for crime
in the populace, but, as the Law decrees,

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:57.070
are drawn toward the guilty and must then
send out us warders.

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:58.070
That is the Law.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:00.000
How could there be a mistake in that?"

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.370
It's like K-money livin' a totalitarian nightmare.

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:08.790
Matta' fact, Kafka style-game makin this whole
novel feel like a tripped out dream.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:14.600
Fo example, when K up in court, he try chunk
deuce outta there, but the magistrate just

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.870
pop up in front of the door like he teleporting
or something.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:18.870
Da hell?

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:23.610
Or when he meeting with his lawyer, da Chief
Clerk just appear in da corner of da room

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.570
like he been creepin in da shadows this whole
time.

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.090
What the hell is he doin over there?

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:34.600
Thang is tho, a few years after Kafka was
runnin the lit game, this shit wasn't a dream

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:35.600
no mo'.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.060
It ended up coming true.

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:44.090
This whole society sound like some kinda totalitarian
prophecy- all da fear and isolation deez whack-ass

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:49.780
places used were hella-similar to Joseph K's
society- straight down to the threadz the

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:51.270
po-lice wore.

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:55.030
And da most fucked up thing bout it ain't
da way they can break yo bones, but da way

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.490
they can break you spirit.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:58.479
And that's exactly the point.

00:06:58.479 --> 00:07:03.210
Evil ain't gotta be some moustache twirling
playa doin gangsta shit.

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:09.020
Sometimes da gnarliest evil is a boring-ass
bureaucracy that wears yo ass down day by

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:14.950
day with bullshit rights and corrupt systems
dat make yo life such a living hell dat you

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:17.180
don't even know what you fightin fo' no mo.

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:22.960
A society like dat can dehumanize you so much
dat you just wanna be takin out back and put

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:23.960
down.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.100
BAM- like a dog.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:27.610
Yo thanks for kickin it with yo boy.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:28.870
Catch y'all next time.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:29.370
Peace!

